n -> n+2 step in the SHELL modulus 2n-1 (the cyclotomic tower advances by 2 per n):
  n=3: shell 2n-1=5;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=7 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even
  n=4: shell 2n-1=7;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=9 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even
  n=5: shell 2n-1=9;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=11 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even
  n=6: shell 2n-1=11;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=13 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even
  n=7: shell 2n-1=13;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=15 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even
  n=8: shell 2n-1=15;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=17 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even
  n=9: shell 2n-1=17;  n+1 -> 2(n+1)-1=19 (+2);  even-fold n->n/2 if even

PARTITION-FUNCTION PRODUCT = ordinal natural sum analog: Z_{A∪B}=Z_A·Z_B iff A,B independent (no shared resonance)
  A=[1],B=[2],gap1/6: Z_A*Z_B=['4/9', '4/9', '1/9']  Z_(A∪B)=['1/2', '1/3', '1/6']  multiplicative=False
